  <releases>
    <release version="0.1.0" date="2026-10-31" type="stable">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/Octodillo/Kadence/releases/tag/v0.1.0</url>
      <description>
        <p>The first release. Kadence can record, arrange, edit, mix and export a song:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Audio and MIDI recording onto armed tracks, with a count-in and a metronome</li>
          <li>An arrange view with fades, clip gain, loops and automation lanes</li>
          <li>A piano roll with quantize, humanize and transpose</li>
          <li>Instrument tracks with the built-in synth, the sampler or a plugin instrument</li>
          <li>A mixer with effects, sends, buses and output routing</li>
          <li>CLAP, VST3 and LV2 plugins, each in its own process</li>
          <li>Tempo, time signature and tap tempo</li>
          <li>Export to WAV or FLAC</li>
          <li>Backups, crash recovery and relinking of moved audio files</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
